<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!DOCTYPE Bill PUBLIC "-//LSC//DTD Authoring Bill XML//EN" "billauthoring.top"><Bill version="1.0" type="introLN"><IntroducedBillHeader><RequestNumber>H-5573.1</RequestNumber><BillNumber>SUBSTITUTE HOUSE BILL 3264</BillNumber><StateLegSession><State>State of Washington</State><Legislature>60th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2008 Regular Session</Session></StateLegSession><Sponsors>House Capital Budget (originally sponsored by Representatives Loomis, Ormsby, Liias, and Wood)</Sponsors><IntroHistory><ReadDate>READ FIRST TIME 02/12/08.  </ReadDate></IntroHistory></IntroducedBillHeader><BriefDescription>Regarding public works projects.</BriefDescription><BillBody><BillTitle><LineNumber line=" 1" page="1,1" hrt="no" />	AN ACT Relating to public works projects; and creating a new<LineNumber line=" 2" page="1,2" />section.</BillTitle><EnactingClause><LineNumber line=" 3" page="1,3" hrt="no" />BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF WASHINGTON:</EnactingClause><BillSection type="new"><LineNumber line=" 4" page="1,4" hrt="no" /><BegSecNew><NewSecText>NEW SECTION.</NewSecText><SecNum>Sec. </SecNum></BegSecNew><RCWSLText>It is the intent of the legislature to adopt<LineNumber line=" 5" page="1,5" />legislation to reevaluate the policy goals and priorities for the<LineNumber line=" 6" page="1,6" />public works board.</RCWSLText></BillSection><BillEnd>--- END ---<PageNumberFooter lastpage="yes">		p. 1	SHB 3264</PageNumberFooter></BillEnd></BillBody></Bill>